            <transmitInfo>
                <fw>PATRONS ARE REQUESTED TO FAVOR THE COMPANY BY CRITICISM AND SUGGESTION CONCERNING ITS SERVICE</fw>
                <place>HOTEL BARCLAY N.Y.</place> 
                <date when="1929-04-30">APR 30 1929</date>
                <time tod="AM">841A</time>
                <sender>LUCKNER</sender>
                <addressee>
                    <name type="place">Erie, Pennsylvania</name>
                </addressee>
                <fw>The filing time as shown in the date line on full-rate telegrams and day letters, and the time of receipt at destination as shown on all messages, is STANDARD TIME.</fw>
            </transmitInfo>
        </topPage>
        
        <div form="message">
            <p>
                <name type="boat">YACHT AMIDA</name>
                <place>HOTEL BARCLAY NEW YORK</place>
                <date when="1929-04-30">APR 230 1929</date>
                
                <name type="person">E R BEHREND</name>
                <place>ERIEPA</place>
                <name type="boat">AMIDA</name>BY JOE THAT WAS QUITE A RESPECTABLE MAIDEN TRIP OF YOUR YACHT HEARTIEST CONGRATULATIONS DID NOT RECEIVE LETTER I AM MAY 4TH AND 5TH NEWYORK HOTEL MAJESTIC CAN I SEE YOU PLEASE SEND ANSWER HOTEL TAFT NEWHAVEN CONN WHERE I AM
                MAY 2ND
                <name type="person">LUCKNER</name>
            </p>
        </div>
        
